{"title":"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sum\" title=\"Sum\">sum</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/d/17d71f840382d863f3be752526cd7768a0dc4145.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\frac17+3\\frac12+5\\frac{1}{19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"118\" height=\"37\" /> is between\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/c/adc682d5c1f0c4cd54209a8cafbe04dd6d494d07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 10\\text{ and }10\\frac12 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 10\\frac12 \\text{ and } 11 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 11\\text{ and }11\\frac12 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 11\\frac12 \\text{ and }12 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 12\\text{ and }12\\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"723\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/1/881de5863809c67466805631c116a9a1d6c098d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{7}&lt;\\frac14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/b/ffb39503dfec6857047f31db016d6d0d11e46c00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{19}&lt;\\frac14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" />, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/4/784764c946062851294ad4ef3060b50efa804f0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\frac17+3\\frac12+5\\frac{1}{19}&lt;2\\frac14+3\\frac12+5\\frac14 =11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"299\" height=\"38\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/3/003e06a633c464511bd83d7ed91e6f2c3e09bd0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\frac17+3\\frac12+5\\frac{1}{19}&gt;2+3\\frac12+5=10\\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"286\" height=\"38\" />.  Therefore, the sum is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/a/9da91c9f6f3424e56b2d7af2e1a285a027fa53a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 10\\frac{1}{2}\\text{ and }11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"134\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c14b959ad23d6343c805d27166b88cf2da8b876.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + \\frac{1}{2} + 3 + \\frac{1}{7} + 5 + \\frac{1}{19} = 2 + 3 + 5 + \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{7} + \\frac{1}{19} = 10\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{7} + \\frac{1}{19} = 10\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{26}{133}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"644\" height=\"38\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/a/82a479ab18bf1cdc9c785f05ca060048079c2b13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{26}{133} &lt; \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" />, this sum must be between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/494fe005be1ba81902159bd4dd3a21e7fcedceaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 10\\frac12 \\text{ and } 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"135\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Anabel.disher\" title=\"User:Anabel.disher\">Anabel.disher</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User_talk:Anabel.disher\" title=\"User talk:Anabel.disher\">talk</a>) 12:49, 18 June 2025 (EDT)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The total sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/4/3e4e1063e2d40a07a181a9606b07bdc7b5ddcae3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 + \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{7} + \\frac{1}{19} = 10 + \\frac{9}{14} + \\frac{1}{19} = 10 + \\frac{185}{266} = 10 \\frac{185}{266}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"436\" height=\"38\" />, which is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/494fe005be1ba81902159bd4dd3a21e7fcedceaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 10\\frac12 \\text{ and } 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"135\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME\" title=\"1987 AJHSME\">1987 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title